# =================================================================================================
# Claude Code
# =================================================================================================
# `.claude/settings.json` and `.claude/hooks/` are committed deliberately: the secret guard is a
# review gate, and the assignment offers credit for submitting the prompts that shaped the work.
# The local override is per-developer and carries machine-specific paths, so it stays out.
.claude/settings.local.json

